"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_torturer","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Torturer","database_level":0},{"enemy_id":"enemy_1365_spnwiz_2","slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_fluxcaster_captain","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Fluxcaster Captain","database_level":0},{"enemy_id":"enemy_1366_dcolle_2","slug":"sarkaz_bloodnexus","name":"Sarkaz Bloodnexus","database_level":0},{"enemy_id":"enemy_1367_dseed","slug":"blood_amber","name":"Blood Amber","database_level":0},{"enemy_id":"enemy_1369_bmbcar1","slug":"anti_witchcraft_repositionable_bomb","name":"Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb","database_level":0},{"enemy_id":"enemy_1370_bmbcar2","slug":null,"name":"Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb","database_level":0}],"suppliedUnits":{"fixed_squad":[],"deployable_tokens":[]},"hasConditionalSpawns":true},"borrowedGeometryFrom":null,"enemyDetails":{"gift_of_magnanimity":{"slug":"gift_of_magnanimity","name":"Gift of Magnanimity","icon":"/enemies-icons/Gift of Magnanimity.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A creation of the Sanguinarch of Vampires' Originium Arts that bears exceptional vitality. One who was powerful in life will continue to be a great threat to their enemies even after being reshaped by the power of the Sanguinarch's blessing. Therefore, those who continue ought to thank the Sanguinarch for his magnanimity.","abilities":["Reborn Creation (takes greatly reduced Physical and Arts damage)","Units blocking it gain +1 Block (up to a maximum of +6)"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":800,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"bloodborn_spawn":{"slug":"bloodborn_spawn","name":"Bloodborn Spawn","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bloodborn Spawn.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A creation of the Sanguine Court's Originium Arts. It is said that just a few drops of fresh blood can spawn an entire swarm of these mindless worms. Once they've latched on, they will never let go until their hunger and thirst have been sated.","abilities":["Deals Arts damage and gains increased ATK depending on the number of units the target is blocking.","Attacks restore HP proportional to damage dealt","Leaves behind <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":100,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"sarkaz_heirbearer_annihilator":{"slug":"sarkaz_heirbearer_annihilator","name":"Sarkaz Heirbearer Annihilator","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Heirbearer Annihilator.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An elite long-range bombardier of the Sarkaz Royal Court that has received the blessing of the Sanguinarch of Vampires. They do not aim at any particular target or tangible enemy. The only thing reflected in their eyes is ruination itself.","abilities":["Deals long-ranged attacks that explode after a delay, inflicting Physical damage in an area.","Will be reborn as a <Touch of Benevolence> after falling in battle for the first time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":550,"def":150,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_boneguard_fluxcaster_captain":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_fluxcaster_captain","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Fluxcaster Captain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Fluxcaster Captain.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A Sarkaz Caster responsible for guarding the Feranmut's skeleton, their nature warped due to perpetually drifting through spacetime along with it, to the point that their very existence has become tenuous. In times of emergency, they will call upon the Feranmut's power to hide within the turbulent folds of spacetime before reappearing at a more opportune time to deliver a fatal blow.","abilities":["If defeated within range of a Bloodcalling Altar, slips into a turbulence in spacetime and cannot be attacked during this period.","Will revive on the field when affected by an altar's pulse."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":420,"def":300,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_bloodnexus":{"slug":"sarkaz_bloodnexus","name":"Sarkaz Bloodnexus","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Bloodnexus.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A very special entity within the Crimson Court, ensuring that each strand of blood weaves the decrees issued by the Regent of the Royal Court. They collect the essence condensed from the blood spilled on the battlefield and wait for it to be returned to the cycle of slaughter through the ancient rituals of the vampires.","abilities":["Cannot be blocked.","Collects up to 5 pieces of dropped <Blood Amber>. When defeated, drops all collected <Blood Amber>."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":100,"def":400,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"sarkaz_boneguard_torturer":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_torturer","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Torturer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Torturer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An elite armsmaster responsible for protecting the Feranmut's skeleton, carefully selected by the most senior members of the Military Commission. The degree of their fusion with the Feranmut's nerves defies common understanding, with their ancient witchcraft drilled deep into their bodies.","abilities":["Recovers a portion of HP and gains increased ATK when either enemy or friendly units are defeated within range (can stack).","Leaves behind 2 <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":1200,"def":1200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_boneguard_captain":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_captain","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Captain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Captain.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A guard captain responsible for protecting the Feranmut's skeleton. As some of the most fervent adherents of the Military Commission, they will realize the Commission's will at any cost, even if they must shed their own blood.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked by friendly units.","Upon receiving damage, reduces the ASPD of the attacker.","Prevents <Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bombs> from moving when nearby.","Leaves behind 2 <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":1100,"def":1500,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.8}},"anti_witchcraft_repositionable_bomb":{"slug":"anti_witchcraft_repositionable_bomb","name":"Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb","icon":"/enemies-icons/Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A bomb whose explosion can suppress the effects of Sarkaz witchcraft, with a prototype delivery platform originating from Victoria. After being modified by a certain demolition expert, it has become a trump card in our desperate battles.","abil